+during such a wait ends the campaign STOPPED within about a second. If every allowed retry fails, the campaign ends
+ERROR and says how many retries were tried. The agent itself keeps one retry per request. Plans saved earlier, and
+baseline or compare plans, keep one retry per request ([details](PRODUCT_TRANSPORT_RETRY_2026-09-29.md#12-rule-v2-faultlabs-own-lab-roles-back-off-september-30-0-not-yet-run-live)).
 
